  "status": "present",
  "value": "level-3 state plus a running pending sum and a per-account stack of funding records; CANCEL pops records that are settled or cancelled (they never qualify again because days do not decrease) and cancels the top one. Complexity target: O(log f) amortised per command/O(accounts + funding) space.",
